	(text "Top/bottom mode, 2 V span:\nMODE=AVDD, REFSENSE=GND,\nREFTS=VREF (2 V), REFBS=GND\n-> AIN 0..2 V.\nCLAMPIN = 2 V x 4.3k/14.3k\n= 0.60 V -> back porch at\ncode ~77, sync tip ~19,\nwhite ~211.\nDRVDD from the Tang Nano\n3V3: 3.3 V CMOS outputs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0e799cec-0b07-592f-a393-291a0a6e7007")
	)
	(text "MS9280 ADC  (10 bit, 27 MS/s)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "16c8212d-1b71-5249-8fb6-fbf6f60c2a02")
	)
	(text "VIDEO INPUT, 6 MHz ANTI-ALIAS FILTER, BUFFER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "300704e1-7cb7-5810-b90c-cae8a67ec208")
	)
	(text "Black burst (or any composite video) reference for genlock /\nframe sync. Open JP2 for hi-Z loop-through.\nR14 + C22: chroma trap so burst doesn't false-trigger the\nslicer (LM1881 datasheet). R15/C24: RSET, 680k for 15.6 kHz.\nU5 shifts the 5 V LM1881 outputs to 3.3 V (LVC inputs are\n5 V tolerant; GW2AR IOs are not). Schmitt cleans the edges.\nREF_CSYNC -> FPGA 41, REF_VSYNC -> FPGA 42, REF_ODD -> FPGA 48\n(shared with J3 pins 4, 3, 5). BPOUT unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6dc476e3-4dcf-4635-8443-143f427b3c7b")
	)
	(text "POWER  (from the Tang Nano header: 5V = USB VBUS, 3V3 = on-board regulator)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6f9d051a-0094-5c2f-8a93-767f3662e955")
	)
	(text "MECHANICAL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a0e4857b-a187-5d6b-b0c8-1b5ee4b3b94c")
	)
	(text "REFERENCE / FRAME SYNC INPUT  (LM1881 sync separator)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.22 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a3ac37d5-80f7-4277-bb32-578685b16b94")
	)
	(text "TANG NANO 20K  (plugs in, USB-C end = header pin 1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 273.05 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a573e5d0-536a-5079-9fde-d397ef837359")
	)
	(text "5th-order Butterworth LC ladder, 75 ohm in / 75 ohm out\n(source back-termination + R1). Flat to ~4.4 MHz (chroma),\n-3 dB at 6 MHz, ~ -35 dB at 13.5 MHz (Nyquist at 27 MS/s).\nC0G caps, wirewound inductors. Open JP1 for hi-Z loop-through.\n\nBuffer gain = 1 + R5/R6 = 1.5: 1 Vpp video -> 1.5 Vpp at the ADC\n(~192 codes/V on a 2 V span). Biased at VBIAS = 2.0 V; R6 returns\nto VBIAS so the DC gain is 1. R7 + C8 are the MS9280 clamp input\nnetwork (R_IN >= 10 ohm, C_IN = 1 uF per datasheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "da606799-b0b5-5170-b8ff-27356316906f")
	)
	(text "33 ohm series R at the source end of each line.\nHeader pins 6-7 and 15-18 are the on-board LEDs: leave free.\nFPGA 32-40 are not on the header (33-40 drive HDMI)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 273.05 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e8efeebd-1e4d-5652-a7b2-8f8463b9feb2")
	)
	(text "+3.3VA: quiet LDO for the ADC analog supply.\n+5VA: filtered 5 V for the video amp."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ea2e6930-1a14-5fe0-8830-64ddcedc1e17")
	)
